<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch add CPI to this week's indicators.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch add CPI to this week's indicators.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics added the October consumer price index to the list of key economic indicators it plans to publish this week:</p>
<p>Key indicators now scheduled for this week are listed below:</p>
<p>GMT----date---indicator---------period---previous</p>
<p>    0830  06/11   retail sales	Sept     +7.1 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0930  08/11   CPI		   Oct	+2.0 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>Publication of the following indicators is provisionally planned for the week beginning November 11. The dates are subject to confirmation by the CBS on November 8.</p>
<p>GMT----date---indicator---------period---previous</p>
<p>    0830  14/11   unemployment SA   Aug/Oct  441,000/6.7 pct</p>
<p>    0830  14/11   unemployment NSA  Aug/Oct  441,000/6.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
